Rule 1 (input must be a tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor must have a floating-point or complex dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10
