Rule 3 (each dimension size of the input tensor is non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 7 (explicit conditional acceptance only for supported dtypes)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 then true else if dtype_(v_1) = 9 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 10 then true else false
